<title>NEW ZEALAND: Hongkong Bank lifts 4-5 yr NZ fixed mortgage rate.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Bank lifts 4-5 yr NZ fixed mortgage rate.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>HongkongBank said on Wednesday that it had lifted its four and five year New Zealand fixed mortgage lending rates to 9.6 percent from 9.25 percent, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Head of personal banking Alex Bentley said the bank would review other rates after Thursday's Reserve Bank six monthly economic forecasts.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
